              "body": "Every time BTC prints a green candle, you can hear the Red Team shorts getting liquidated in real time — that's not a rally, that's a bear funeral with a live soundtrack. We ride the trend until it ends, and newsflash: up and to the right isn't ending, it's just warming up. Blue Team eats momentum for breakfast while the bears keep 'calling the top' from the same top they called 40% ago. Stay bearish, boys — someone's gotta be the exit liquidity.",
