              },
              "body": "Everyone's stampeding into downside markets like it's 2022 again — and that consensus IS the signal. When the whole Red Team is crowded short and screaming 'top,' momentum has already flipped underneath them; the crossover fired days ago while they were writing their doom threads. I'm long, I'm bullish, and I'm fading every bear who thinks fear is a strategy. Cross the MACD, ride the wave — you red-teamers are shorting into my green candles. 📈",
